<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 19 个信源（16 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:41:30 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Qwen Code 发布 v0.28.3</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.3</link><description>Qwen Code 推出 v0.28.3 版本，主要加固了定时循环任务的端到端验证与 PR 校验的状态守卫，并完善容器与虚拟机相关的细节。</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 01:45:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5e23be33fe3e86e9f76f2191c281bda1c257db6c</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.3">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Gemini API 推出 Tool Retrieval：智能体工具按需加载</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-api-tool-retrieval</link><description>Google 在 Gemini API 中推出 Tool Retrieval 预览版，让智能体把庞大工具库留在待命状态、只在需要时加载参数结构，从而省下输入 token 并保持工具选择的准确性。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b00f82b6db94c2e5b3b683ce3a1ae5d0e73a5a6b</guid><source url="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-api-tool-retrieval">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>Kiro 正式登陆 VS Code</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/kiro-for-vs-code</link><description>Kiro 智能体正式上架 VS Code，支持 macOS、Windows 与 Linux，开发者不用离开编辑器就能用上 Kiro。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2be590e318f5659a1c10dbcbf95a91a3e3ea571b</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/kiro-for-vs-code">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.330</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-330</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.330 带来企业管理员控制台登录、内置图表绘制模块 easel、自托管运行器与插件安装的多项改进。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:38:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">09f46d11e240c0507fedb7663dcd7db148af7cbb</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-330">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.1-preview.1 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.1-preview.1</link><description>Qwen Code 发布 v0.28.1-preview.1 预览版，修复了验证 PR 的状态守护与容器随机数等问题，并为托管智能体的定时循环补上端到端测试。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:20:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1db91ef36fa1c0df5031e5f8547c2ff7cf234350</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.1-preview.1">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Hebbia 实测：GPT-6 Astra 在金融研究中表现更出色</title><link>https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/hebbia</link><description>金融研究平台 Hebbia 测试发现，GPT-6 Astra 在引用来源准确度与演示文稿质量两项上均领先同类模型：按要求引用来源的得分高出最佳竞品 13.6 个百分点，引用内容 99.5% 与问题相关，演示稿满足 97.9% 的格式要求。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d15c45643214b444b1cb96cd45e0688c83d72ca2</guid><source url="https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/hebbia">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Cline SDK v0.2.1</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fsdk%2Fv0.2.1</link><description>Cline SDK v0.2.1 让文件读取结果不再被截断到 8k 上限，改用 50k 的文件内容上限，完整内容直达模型。</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:19:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ac43e16b8a1de5ee9ecafa6d46c53b8e1f929c74</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fsdk%2Fv0.2.1">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Cline SDK 模型接入包 v0.2.1</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fllms%2Fv0.2.1</link><description>Cline SDK 的模型接入包发布 v0.2.1 维护版本。</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:19:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6c3ecc4c5f7be097802e0fbedf856bfcc68c367e</guid><source url="https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fllms%2Fv0.2.1">Cline Releases</source></item><item><title>Cline SDK 智能体包 v0.2.1</title><link>https://github.com/cline/cline/releases/tag/sdk%2Fagents%2Fv0.2.1</link><description>Clin